WF-44 — Feedback Recorder

## Summary

- Inputs: phoneNumber, userId, messageText, userStatus
- Outputs: feedback text saved to users row; WhatsApp acknowledgement sent; OR rerouted to WF-45/WF-47 if intent says so
- State Transitions: none on the feedback path (clears `stage` to NULL). Rebook/stop paths delegate to other WFs.
- Calls Sub-Workflows: WF-25 (Intent Classifier), WF-45 (Rebook), WF-47 (Unsubscribe), WF-50 (Send WhatsApp)

---

## Algorithm

Step 1: Start — triggered by WF-43 after the user typed a feedback message (or pressed Leave Feedback then typed).
Step 2: Call WF-25 (Intent Classifier) with phoneNumber, messageText, userId, userStatus → returns intentResult.
Step 3: Check: intentResult == "rebook_intent"?
  - If YES → go to Step 4
  - If NO  → go to Step 5
Step 4: Call WF-45 (Rebook) with phoneNumber, userId, userStatus. End.
Step 5: Check: intentResult == "stop_intent"?
  - If YES → go to Step 6
  - If NO  → go to Step 7
Step 6: Call WF-47 (Unsubscribe) with phoneNumber, userId, userStatus. End.
Step 7: UPDATE chinmay_astro.users SET feedback = <messageText>, stage = NULL, updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = <userId>.
Step 8: Build acknowledgement: "🙏 Thank you for your feedback! We really appreciate you taking the time to share your experience with Chinmay's consultation service. Your input helps us improve."
Step 9: Call WF-50 with phoneNumber, message=<ack text>.
Step 10: End.
